OL,3,GNEWSATanaiste wants border poll
OL,4,Acriteria talks with London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tanaiste (Irish deputy prime
OL,7,Fminister) has said that a conversation
OL,8,Fbetween the British and Irish
OL,9,Fgovernments over the criteria for a
OL,10,Fborder poll would be "useful".
OL,12,FSimon Harris said he and the Taoiseach
OL,13,F(Irish PM) Micheal Martin are "aligned"
OL,14,Fon the issue.
OL,16,FAdding that it "would be useful at a
OL,17,Fpoint in time to understand the
OL,18,Fcriteria that a British government may
OL,19,Fconsider applying to decide whether or
OL,20,Fnot to call a border poll".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
